      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Very happy with Trentham Electrical.Our LG battery was recalled & refunded, and we took the opportunity to slightly upgrade our system, plus correct an issue with the original installation. I was able to speak directly with the company principal, who was the person doing the actual installation. He understood exactly where I was coming from, and accurately reflected our conversation in a comprehensive email. The business teamwork was seamless, and installation was timely, smooth and thoughtful, incorporating our aesthetic preference too. The quote was competitive, and almost identical to the only other formal quote we received (2 other companies we contacted didn't bother to submit a quote at all).A month down the track our new battery is still performing beautifully, and we feel confident that IF an issue arose, Trentham Electrical would be very responsive.",
